     <p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:29px">202</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:29px">6</span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:29px"><span style="font-family:华文中宋">年绍兴市</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 29px"><span style="font-family:华文中宋">教学活动比赛</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:29px"><span style="font-family:华文中宋">办法</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"> </span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">为了加强对绍兴市各项</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教学活动比赛</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">的规范化管理，进一步提高</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">的科学性、公正性和权威性，充分发挥</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教学活动比赛</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">对</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">提高我市基础教育教学质量和教师专业水平的积极作用，特制定本办法。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">一、</span><span style=";font-family:黑体;letter-spacing:1px;font-size:21px">教学活动比赛</span><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">的类别</span></p><p style="text-indent:47px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:21px">202</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:21px">6</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年绍兴市</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教学活动比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">包括</span>“<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教育教学论文</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:21px">”<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">和</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">课堂教学比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:21px">”<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">两</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">类</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。两类</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">都将</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">采用</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">市研究院统一发文并公布结果，学科（或项目）分别实施的操作模式</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（各学科联系人见附件</span>2<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">）。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">二、</span><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">教学活动比赛</span><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">的基本原则</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">1<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">．坚持公开、公平、公正的原则。</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">办法、程序、奖级、获奖数</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">等事先公布，不搞暗箱操作，杜绝人情奖、关系奖。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">2<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">．严格控制</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">项目。除了</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">市</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">研究院规定的</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教学活动比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">外，其它临时组织的</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">活动，须经分管院长审批，院长办公会议批准同意。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">3<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">．关注新课程新教材背景下学科关键问题的研究与突破。各学科应立足新考改、新课程和新教材实施的相关意见及文件精神，结合省教研室的学科</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教学比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">要求，从着眼解决本学科教学中的关键问题出发，</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">确定教育教学</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">论文</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">、</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">课堂</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教学</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">的主题，并在学科研修计划中注明。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">4<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">．确保质量，宁缺毋滥。原则上实行差额评选，控制获奖数量。论文</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">奖级一般分一、二、三等奖，</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"> <span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">课堂</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">学比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">奖级分一、二等奖，不设特等奖、鼓励奖、荣誉奖等。根据实际情况，一等奖可以空缺。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">三、教育教学研究评审的一般程序</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（一）明确项目。市研究院在年度工作计划中列出</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">项目。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（二）组织推荐。参评个人与材料须经各区、县（市）教育局教研室（教师发展中心、教育研究中心）在组织相关</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">后推荐上报。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（三）资格审查。各学科应认真审查参</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">赛资格或</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">材料，发现有学术诚信、科学性错误、版权、质量等问题的材料，或在上级、同级评审中已经获奖的材料，不予参</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（四）聘请评委。各项教学</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">活动比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">应聘请师德好、业务水平高的骨干教师、教研员担任评委。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（五）组织</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。各类</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">采取事先公开</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">办法、标准、程序、奖级、获奖数等，评委根据</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">标准独立评分，数据汇总和合成应在评委范围内公开进行，</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">结果须经所有评委签字认可并报市研究院备案。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（六）结果公示。</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">结果在市研究院网站上公示</span>5<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">个工作日。</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">参</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">论文须向相关联络人报送电子文档</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。如发现有诚信缺失等问题，将对相关责任人进行通报，</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">并在三年内不予参加绍兴市级及以上相关教学</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">活动。同时，</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">酌情减少出现诚信缺失问题区域的下届参</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">名额。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（七）发文公布。</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">结果经公示无异议，由市研究院统一发文公布并发放证书。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">四、</span><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">教学活动比赛</span><span style=";font-family:黑体;font-size:21px">的具体规定</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:楷体_GB2312;font-size:21px">（一）教育教学论文</span><span style=";font-family:楷体_GB2312;font-size:21px">比赛</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教育教学论文</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">包括</span>“<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">学科教学论文</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">”<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">和</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">“</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教育专项研究论文</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">”<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">两个类别。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">1<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">．</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">时间安排：</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">每年评审一次。年初市研究院统一发文布置，各学科（项目）在学期初教研员会议上公布</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">主题和参</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">要求。各区、县（市）在本级</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">的基础上择优选送，</span>6<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">月</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">30</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">日前将选送的论文纸质稿和学科（项目）</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">参赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">篇目汇总表（见附件</span>3<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">）分学科寄送给本院相关学科（项目）教研员，并将各学科（项目）论文和</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">参赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">篇目汇总表的电子稿发送到各教研员的钉钉或电子邮箱（逾期恕不受理）。</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">7<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">月</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">15</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">日</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">前完成</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，及时进行公示，</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">随后</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">统一发文公布。个别学科如有省级</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">提前等特殊情况，可提前组织</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:楷体_GB2312;font-size:21px">2．</span><span style=";font-family:楷体_GB2312;font-size:21px">论文类别及获奖数目</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px">1<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">）</span></span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">学科教学论文：</span></span></strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">小学语文、小学数学、初中语文、初中数学、初中英语、初中科学、</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">初中</span></span><span style=";font-family:仿宋_GB2312;font-size:21px">历史</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">、</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">高中语文、高中数学、高中英语、中小学音乐、中小学美术、中小学劳动等学科</span>35<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">篇；小学英语、小学道德与法治、小学科学、高中思想政治、高中物理、高中化学、高中生物、高中历史、高中地理、高中通用技术、高中信息技术、义教段信息科技、小学体育、中学体育、义教段综合实践</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">、</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">心理健康</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教育</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">等学科</span>25<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">篇；</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">义教</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">地方</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">与校本</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">课程</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">、</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">特殊教育</span>20<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">篇；义教段书法、高中综合实践等学科</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">15</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">篇；</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">学前</span></span><span style=";font-fam