 style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px">1973357939@qq.com</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">各学科（项目）的获奖数与参</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">数之比一般不高于</span>80%<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，设一、二、三等奖，比例分别为</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">20%</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">、</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">30%</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">、</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">50%</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:楷体_GB2312;font-size:21px">3．</span><span style=";font-family:楷体_GB2312;font-size:21px">论文报送要求</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">参</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">论文应围绕各学科（项目）规定的研究主题，突出科学性、前瞻性、学科性和实践性。论文要求论点鲜明，观点科学，论据确凿，论证有力，逻辑严密，</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">语言规范</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，字数一般不超过</span>6000<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">字。已在市级及以上报刊公开发表或各类征文竞赛中获奖的论文不再参</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。除教研员调研报告外，超过</span>8000<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">字或以课题报告、调研报告形式撰写的不予评奖。论文用</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">word</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">文档</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">A4</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">纸打印，一式</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">4</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">份（其中</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">1</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">份在文章标题下行注明作者单位、姓名、联系电话，其余</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">3</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">份隐去上述内容），正文中不得出现作者姓名、单位、联系电话、所在地区等信息。正文字体为小</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">4</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">号宋体。参</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">论文作者署名不得多于</span>2<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">人。</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">每个学科（项目）教学论文</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">中，同一单位参评论文不能超过</span>3<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">篇</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（教研员调研报告除外）</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，每位教师两个类别的论文最多各报送</span>1<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">篇（包括合作作者），</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">同一篇论文只能参加一个类别的</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。若启用线上</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">评比</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">系统，具体情况另行通知。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">各区、县（市）学科教学论文的参</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">数额分配及其他要求，由学科教研员另行通知。各区、县（市）专项研究论文（案例）的报送数额：教研员调研报告每区、县（市）</span>5<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">篇，其他每个项目</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">10</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">篇，省</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">人工智能赋能教学实验学校和</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">精准教学项目学校</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">、</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">市</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">“</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">品质课堂</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">”</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">深化行动基地学校名额外可再报送</span>1<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">篇相应项目的论文</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，标明学段的专项论文仅限该学段教师参评。</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">为了有效落实各项论文的</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">工作和方便联络，请各区、县（市）安排好相关项目的负责人。同时，及时将有关要求传达到相关学校和教师，并组织做好各项</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">工作。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:楷体_GB2312;font-size:21px">4．</span><span style=";font-family:楷体_GB2312;font-size:21px">评审承诺</span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">凡参加教育教学论文</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">的作者，须</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">提交论文查重报告，并</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">填写《绍兴市教育教学论文</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">承诺书》（见附件</span>4<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">），承诺其教育教学论文的原创性、真实性，同意在市研究院网站上公开论文，并经由所在单位签署意见，加盖公章。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（二）</span></span></strong><strong><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">课堂教学比赛</span></span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:47px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">课堂教学比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">旨在以</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">为载体，立足课程标准的基本要求，体现</span>“<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">品质课堂</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">”</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">的七个要素</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">关注学科素养、关注学习状况、关注学习趣乐、关注问题思辨、关注实践体验、关注资源技术和关注学习效果</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">）</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，开展学科核心素养观照下的品质课堂实践与探索，充分体现资源与</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">数字</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">技术在学科课堂教学中的融入与运用。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">1</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">．</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">名称：绍兴市</span>××××<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';letter-spacing:1px;font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">课堂教学比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">2</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">．</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">时间安排</span>: <span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">各学科</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">原则上</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">每两年一次</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。其中，中小学音乐、美术、综合实践活动等学科，分小学、初中、高中三个学段轮流举办，三年一轮；义教地方课程与校本课程、劳动、义教段</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">信息技术</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">等学科</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">分小学</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">、初中</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">两个学段轮流举办，两年一轮；幼儿教育分城乡每年举办</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">；</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">根据需要开展中小学班会课等比赛活动。</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年初市教育教学研究院统一发文布置要求。学科教研员根据院项目工作要求安排时间组织</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">，各区、县（市）参</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教师须在本级</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">的基础上产生并填写选送汇总表（见附件</span>5<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">），于</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">前</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">一</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">月报本院相关学科教研员。各学科须在</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">活动结束</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">的</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">一周内将</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">结果报送课程教研科并在市研究院网站公示</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">结果。</span>12<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">月由市研究院统一公布</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">结果。</span>    </span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">3</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">．</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">形式。一般采用现场教学活动的形式，具体程序为：</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">在活动开始</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">5<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">～</span><span style="font-family:Times New Roman">7</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">天前确定并通知教学内容，评审当天参</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教师抽签决定上课顺序；参</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教师按抽签顺序进行</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">课堂</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">教学，评委当场评分。</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">各学科可以根据省级</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">评审</span></span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">要求作出相应调整。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:43px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:40px"><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">4</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">．</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">202</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px">6</span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">年</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">比赛学</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">科</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">（</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">项目）</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">及取奖数量上限：各区、县（市）推荐</span>1<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">位教师参</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">赛</span></span><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:21px"><span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。奖级设一、二等奖，其中一等奖比例不超过</span>50%<span style="font-family:仿宋_GB2312">。</span></span></p><table><tbody><tr style="height:30px" class="firstRow"><td width="126" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 2px 1px 2px 2px; border-color: windowtext;"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 14px">学  科</span></strong></p></td><td width="97" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 2px 1px; border-color: windowtext;"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 14px">取奖上限</span></strong></p></td><td width="217" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 2px 1px; border-color: windowtext;"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 14px">学  科</span></strong></p></td><td width="93" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 2px 2px 2px 1px; border-color: windowtext;"><p style=";text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';font-size: 14px">取奖上限</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style="height:30px"><td width="126" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left-width: 2px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p><span style=";font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px">小学道德与法治</span></p></td><td width="97" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-left-width: 1px; border-left-color: windowtext; border-right-width: 1px; border-right-color: windowtext; border-top: none; border-bottom-width: 1px; border-bottom-color: windowtext;"><p style=";text-align:center"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:14px">6</span></p></td><td width="217" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-color: windowtext;"><p><span style=";fon